## 5. Badge — Tier Prize Badge

### 5.1 Size

Badge trong table row: **`text-xs font-bold`** (12px).

```tsx
// ✅ ĐÚNG
<Badge className={`${p.color} w-9 justify-center text-xs font-bold`}>
  {p.badge}
</Badge>

// ❌ SAI — text-[10px] vi phạm minimum readability
<Badge className={`${p.color} w-9 justify-center text-[10px] font-bold`}>
  {p.badge}
</Badge>
```

### 5.2 Jackpot Tag Badge

Dùng `Badge` component variant="secondary" thay vì custom `<span>`:

```tsx
// ✅ ĐÚNG
<Badge
  variant="secondary"
  className="text-xs font-bold bg-red-100 text-red-700 dark:bg-red-900/50 dark:text-red-300"
>
  Jackpot 1
</Badge>

// ❌ SAI — custom span, text-[10px]
<span className="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold bg-red-100 text-red-700">
  Jackpot 1
</span>
```

### 5.3 Timezone Badge

```tsx
// ✅ ĐÚNG
<Badge variant="secondary" className="ml-1 font-mono text-xs">
  Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh
</Badge>

// ❌ SAI — text-[10px]
<Badge variant="secondary" className="ml-1 font-mono text-[10px]">
  Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh
</Badge>
