## 6. Data Cell Typography

### 6.1 Cell Variants

| Cell type | Class |
|-----------|-------|
| Label (tier name) | `text-sm font-medium` |
| Sub-label (desc) | `text-xs text-muted-foreground` |
| Number (amount, prob) | `text-xs tabular-nums` hoặc `text-sm tabular-nums` |
| Current value (readonly) | `text-xs tabular-nums text-muted-foreground` |
| Computed (expected payout) | `text-xs tabular-nums font-medium` |
| % Ratio | `text-xs tabular-nums font-semibold` + semantic color |
| Tooltip target | thêm `cursor-help` |

### 6.2 Semantic Colors cho Data Cells

CHỈ 3 semantic colors cho ratio/percentage data:

| Condition | Color | Use case |
|-----------|-------|----------|
| Lỗ / vượt ngưỡng | `text-red-600` | payout ratio > 100%, over break-even |
| Cảnh báo | `text-amber-600` | payout ratio 50-100% |
| Tốt / có lãi | `text-emerald-600` | payout ratio < 50%, margin dương |

```tsx
// ✅ ĐÚNG — 3 tầng semantic
<span className={`text-xs tabular-nums font-semibold ${
  ratio > 1 ? "text-red-600"
  : ratio > 0.5 ? "text-amber-600"
  : "text-emerald-600"
}`}>

// ❌ SAI — dùng violet, indigo, hoặc màu trang trí cho data
<span className="text-violet-600 font-semibold">{rate}%</span>
```

### 6.3 Text read-only (không phải data semantic)

Dùng `text-muted-foreground` — KHÔNG dùng custom color:

```tsx
// ✅ ĐÚNG — planned rate column (read-only, informational)
<span className="text-xs tabular-nums font-semibold text-muted-foreground">
  {rate.toFixed(2)}%
</span>

// ❌ SAI — violet không có ý nghĩa semantic
<span className="text-xs tabular-nums font-semibold text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400">
  {rate.toFixed(2)}%
</span>
```

